And so, Red team won the first round.

788
00:54:51,683 --> 00:54:55,703
2戦先勝なので、あと2回勝ったチームが勝利ですからね。
It's first to 2 wins, so whichever team wins next takes the victory!

789
00:54:55,703 --> 00:55:00,603
おー！やったー！
Yay!

790
00:55:01,156 --> 00:56:01,806
あ！
Ah!

791
