Get 'em, big bro!

799
00:55:20,029 --> 00:55:22,529
よし！やれ！やれ！
Alright! Get 'em!

800
00:55:23,029 --> 00:55:24,329
いけ！
Go!

801
00:55:24,691 --> 00:55:25,951
