Blue wins!

802
00:55:29,929 --> 00:55:30,729
やばい！
Oh no!

803
00:55:30,829 --> 00:55:35,029
赤の暴力！やばいよ、ねこたんね！
Red's brutality! That's bad, Neko-tan!

804
00:55:35,529 --> 00:55:39,029
